<GlassCard>
    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <p><strong>Q. Where do I download iloader?</strong> A. This website and the GitHub repository linked below are the only official sources.</p>
    <p><strong>Q. Is iloader free?</strong> A. Yes. iloader is free and open source.</p>
    <p><strong>Q. What platforms are supported?</strong> A. iloader supports Windows, Linux (arm and x86_64), and macOS.</p>
    <p><strong>Q. What can iloader install?</strong> A. iloader automatically sets up SideStore or LiveContainer+SideStore, but can also import any IPA.</p>
    <p><strong>Q. How do I get help with iloader?</strong> A. iloader will offer suggestions to resolve most common errors, but if you need more help, you can join the <a href="https://discord.gg/MgTGPhdXrW" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">discord!</a></p>
    <p><strong>Q. Can you add [random feature]?</strong> A. iloader is currently only recieving important bug fixes as the next major version, iloader-next, is in development.</p>
</GlassCard>